<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ param-needed · filter-malformed · watch-id-malformed · watch-unnamed · watch-faceless · watch-bound · watch-withdrawn · wiki-unreached

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`param-needed` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.watches filter/<filter>]] ~ a bind names its filter`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`filter-malformed` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.watches filter/<filter>]] ~ the engine cannot parse the filter or the until; its words ride the refusal`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`watch-id-malformed` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.watches filter/<filter>]] ~ an id reads lower-case words and dashes, 64 at most; drop it to start a watch`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`watch-unnamed` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.watches id/<id> mu/00]] ~ Rest drops the watch its id names`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`watch-faceless` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.watches filter/<filter> face/<N>]] ~ the call rode no session, so it names no face to attribute the watch to`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`watch-bound` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.watches id/<id> mu/00]] ~ this face holds its whole bound of watches, every one held by a call; let one answer or drop one`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`watch-withdrawn` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.watches filter/<filter>]] ~ the caller left mid-hold, so the watch dropped with its record`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`wiki-unreached` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.watches filter/<filter> recipe/default]] ~ no wiki this face hosts or holds a share of answers the slug`>>
```

