<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ changed · unchanged · ended · removed · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`changed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[recipe id title filter band asOf titles total]] ~ the digest moved; asOf names the cursor the next call hands back`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`unchanged` params=`exit/0 fields/[[recipe id title filter band asOf titles total]] ~ the hold ran out with the digest unmoved`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`ended` params=`exit/0 fields/[[recipe id title filter band asOf titles total until]] ~ until answered; the watch dropped`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`removed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[recipe id title band]] ~ the watch left: a Rest call, or the book's bound let it go`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/4 ~ the engine or the door refused by name; nothing moved past it`>>
```

